				<description>&lt;p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;      &#xA;        &#xA;          &#xA;          &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;          &#xA;          &#xA;          &#xA;        &#xA;      &#xA;    &#xA;      &#xA;        &#xA;          &#xA;          &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;          &#xA;          &#xA;          &#xA;        &#xA;      &#xA;    &#xA;      &#xA;        &#xA;          &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;          &#xA;          &#xA;          &#xA;        &#xA;      &#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;picture&gt;&#xA;      &lt;source&#xA;        type=&#34;image/webp&#34;&#xA;        srcset=&#34;https://jadi.space/blog/the-internet-is-becoming-the-street-with-checkpoints/img-01_hu_36120902a4465c99.webp 300w,/blog/the-internet-is-becoming-the-street-with-checkpoints/img-01_hu_5a73f3b4be1365b4.webp 500w,/blog/the-internet-is-becoming-the-street-with-checkpoints/img-01_hu_9817937c1f09fd52.webp 700w&#34;&#xA;        sizes=&#34;(max-width: 499px) 300px,(max-width: 699px) 500px,700px&#34;&#xA;      /&gt;&#xA;      &lt;img&#xA;        src=&#34;https://jadi.space/blog/the-internet-is-becoming-the-street-with-checkpoints/img-01.jpeg&#34;&#xA;        srcset=&#34;https://jadi.space/blog/the-internet-is-becoming-the-street-with-checkpoints/img-01_hu_cf441955b663b3da.jpeg 300w,/blog/the-internet-is-becoming-the-street-with-checkpoints/img-01_hu_dc143a4bf915ba3b.jpeg 500w,/blog/the-internet-is-becoming-the-street-with-checkpoints/img-01_hu_561c7f9004a24571.jpeg 700w&#34;&#xA;        sizes=&#34;(max-width: 499px) 300px,(max-width: 699px) 500px,700px&#34;&#xA;        alt=&#34;sorry for semi unrelated image. I had to had an image and do not want AI in my posts&#34;&#xA;        &#xA;        loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;        width=&#34;1400&#34;&#xA;        height=&#34;2487&#34;&#xA;      /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/picture&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;em&gt;sorry for semi unrelated image. I had to had an image and do not want AI in my posts&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I’ve been robbed on the street. There are sex predators walking on the sidewalk. You might fall while trying to jump over a canal. I’ve even heard about shootings and knife attacks. Streets are dangerous, so why not pass a law stating that everyone stepping outside their home must show ID and fill out a form explaining where they are going, why they are going there, and for how long? This would surely make our streets much safer — although, of course, things could still happen. And naturally, people under 18 wouldn’t be allowed on streets the state considers harmful.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
